  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ワイルドエリアや　キャンプスポットで\nテントを　はったり　そのなかで\nりょうりを　つくることが　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "와일드에리어나 캠핑 스폿에서\n텐트를 치거나 그 안에서\n요리를 만들 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可以用它\n在曠野地帶或營地\n搭起帳篷和製作料理。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ce kit permet d’installer une tente dans les zones\nde camping des Terres Sauvages et d’y cuisiner.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mit diesem Set ist es möglich, in der Naturzone sowie\nan anderen bestimmten Orten ein Zelt aufzuschlagen\nund dort zu kochen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Este kit tiene todo lo necesario para montar una tienda\nde campaña y cocinar, ya sea en el Área Silvestre o en\nzonas de acampada.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Permette di montare una tenda e cucinare nelle\nTerre Selvagge o in altri luoghi adatti al campeggio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Everything you need to set up a tent and get cooking in\na Wild Area or at a camping spot.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ワイルドエリアや　キャンプスポットで\nテントを　張ったり　その中で\n料理を　作ることが　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可以在旷野地带\n或露营营地上搭起帐篷，\n在那里制作料理。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Este kit tiene todo lo necesario para montar una tienda\nde campaña y cocinar, ya sea en el Área Silvestre o en\nzonas de acampada.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
